<!-- Section: The Three Ironclad Guarantees -->
<section class="section">
	<div class="section-header">
		<div class="section-eyebrow">Safety &amp; Architecture</div>
		<h2 class="section-title">The Three Ironclad Guarantees</h2>
		<p class="section-lead">
			Most AI assistants run unverified scripts against your files. Sub-Sub is engineered around strict boundaries where safety is guaranteed by code.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="guarantees-grid">
		<div class="guarantee-card">
			<div class="card-icon-wrap" style="color: var(--diff-add);">
				<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
					<path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
				</svg>
			</div>
			<h3>Code-Enforced Gate</h3>
			<p>
				The model cannot alter your Zotero library on its own. Every modification is first computed as a server-side dry run with a colorized diff (+additions in green, -removals in red) and runs only after your explicit confirmation.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="guarantee-card">
			<div class="card-icon-wrap" style="color: var(--librarian);">
				<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/>
					<path d="M3 3v5h5"/>
					<path d="M12 7v5l4 2"/>
				</svg>
			</div>
			<h3>Universal Undo Journal</h3>
			<p>
				Every executed change is cryptographically recorded in a local SQLite journal. If you ever change your mind, type <code>/undo</code> (or select Undo in your browser) to roll back any tag, collection, or metadata edit instantaneously.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="guarantee-card">
			<div class="card-icon-wrap" style="color: var(--researcher);">
				<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
					<path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
				</svg>
			</div>
			<h3>Air-Gapped Local Privacy</h3>
			<p>
				Binds strictly to <code>127.0.0.1</code> behind an authenticated HTTP-only session cookie. The Librarian operates completely offline with zero web calls. Your references, PDFs, and notes never leave your personal machine.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

